"diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122064.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122064.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-11T16:46:21Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #121989\r\n\r\n`geometry_instance_pair_mask` was used to determine whether lights get paired with geometries to skip unnecessary `_instance_unpair` calls. However, this assumption is incorrect, since lights are always paired with geometries, regardless of the value of this member. Since Forward+ did not have the light bit set in the mask, the unpairing would incorrectly get skipped. To fix this, we always perform unpairing for geometries.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122064/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122064/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}